tags: history eof

=== vi-empty-replace-at-eof
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
add_history "foo"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
\e<pause>kR

=== vi-empty-insert-at-eof
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
add_history "foo"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
\e<pause>ki

=== vi-replace-edit-at-eof
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
add_history "foo"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
\e<pause>kRX

=== emacs-edit-at-eof
--- script
add_history "foo"
readline "> " 1
history_dump
--- keys
\C-px
